{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Laserz is a game where you need to rotate the mirrors into the correct pattern so the laser beam ends up at the end point. This mini-game includes 8 fixed levels along with a dynamic random level generator with 3 difficulty options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you buy and install this DLC, the mini-game will appear on the main menu as an option in the games list. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click or touch the game in the games list to start a new game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Touchscreen Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Woohoo! - Game &quot;Laserz&quot; does <strong>NOT</strong> support touchscreens. Only a mouse and keyboard will work with this mini-game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3556960?t=1741966883","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3556960?t=1741966883","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556960/629e72f7766fd2191eb8dd3de69badd328e72dd9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741966883","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556960/629e72f7766fd2191eb8dd3de69badd328e72dd9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741966883","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Laserz is a game where you need to rotate the mirrors into the correct pattern so the laser beam ends up at the end point. This mini-game includes 8 fixed levels along with a dynamic random level generator with 3 difficulty options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you buy and install this DLC, the mini-game wi